 "_fetch_rule": "Sub-skills never WebFetch a URL directly, not even one copied from this file: unattended sessions raise PROVENANCE_REQUIRED for any URL that was not returned by a WebSearch in that session (confirmed 2026-11-05 on every roster url). Every page is reached by WebSearch (extended mode for anything dated) and then WebFetch of the result link. The url fields below are what to search for and match against, not what to fetch.",
 "column": {
  "post_mode": "pr",
  "site_repo": "tyrel-beede/macrodials",
  "posts_dir": "docs/blog/posts",
  "category": "Columns",
  "note": "pr: post_column.py opens a pull request on the site repo for review (the setting for the first generated columns); push: commit straight to main, one revert undoes a bad week. Change here, never in a skill."
 }
